body:
Studio should not depend on example app packages. Both MSW and server modes should load apps dynamically via `objectstack.config.ts` at runtime.

### Changes

- **`package.json`** — Remove `@example/app-crm` and `@example/app-todo` from dependencies
- **`src/mocks/browser.ts`**, **`src/mocks/simulateBrowser.ts`** — Replace hardcoded example package imports with single import from studio's own `objectstack.config.ts`
- **`objectstack.config.ts`** — Make studio self-contained: add `status`/`priority` select fields and seed data so MSW mode works without external packages
- **Tests** — Update assertions from `todo__task` → `task` (no namespace prefix in studio config)

### Before/After

```ts
// Before: hardcoded example app imports
import todoConfig from '@example/app-todo/objectstack.config';
import crmConfig from '@example/app-crm/objectstack.config';
const bootConfigs = [resolveConfig(todoConfig), resolveConfig(crmConfig)];

// After: single dynamic config source
import studioConfig from '../../objectstack.config';
const bootConfigs = [resolveConfig(studioConfig)];
```

